All scripts implement data preparation based off of the investigations notebook in the Initial_Inspection folder.
To prepare the data you can run these scripts in the following order, or alternatively run do_Everything.py

1) Clean_real_estate_price_data.py 
   Cleans NaN values, missing flags and formatting on the original trade price data set, based off of the Initial_Inspection notebook.

2) Combine.py
   Combines all prefecture data sets and excludes any land-only sales.

3) Merge_Migration_Data.py
   Merges the migraion data. For each property, it appends the previous year's migration value or the earliest available figure.

4) Merge_Coord_Data.py
   Merges coordinate data.

5) Compute_Distances.py
   Computes the distance from each property to the nearest designated city and additionally adds additional position related features.
